GPSBench derived dataset license
================================

The GPSBench task files in `data/` are a derived dataset built from the
GeoNames gazetteer (https://www.geonames.org/).

- GeoNames source data: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- GPSBench derived task files: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
- GPSBench code, evaluator, and scripts: MIT (see LICENSE)

You must retain GeoNames attribution when redistributing the derived data.

This release is versioned by `data/MANIFEST.md` (per-file SHA-256 checksums).
Missing Data (`task11_missing_data`) is a diagnostic configuration, not an
18th main benchmark task.
